WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:04.150
Let's say I wanted to build a calendar app, kind of like Google Calendar.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.080
Which of these parts of the application do you think would be considered part

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.280
of the model?

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.910
The array of calendar events in the application?

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.470
The buttons for Day, Week, and Month?

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.490
Or the render function for the calendar area?

